<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine wheat output 14-14.5 mln T - farm leader.</title>
<headline>Argentine wheat output 14-14.5 mln T - farm leader.</headline>
<byline>Jason Webb</byline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Recent rains have revived much of the ailing crop in the northern and central reaches of Argentina's wheat belt and total output could be as high as 14.5 million tonnes, a top farmers' official said Friday.</p>
<p>&quot;If the weather continues to help, I'd say that production could be 14 million or 14.5 million tonnes,&quot; Rene Bonetto, president of the Argentine Agrarian Federation, told Reuters in an interview.</p>
</text>
